      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760080364475,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Option-3: Client upload directly to S3 in chunks.\nRequires logic on frontend to 1) chunk files and send it to\nS3 2) Notify backend/server when each chunk is successfully uploaded. \nAlso, requires logic  backend to maintain and update metadata on\nnumber of chunks and their uploaded status. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Option-3: Client upload directly to S3 in chunks.\nRequires logic on frontend to 1) chunk files and send it to\nS3 2) Notify backend/server when each chunk is successfully uploaded. \nAlso, requires logic  backend to maintain and update metadata on\nnumber of chunks and their uploaded status. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
